Iin 5 0 DC <value> ; Current source from node 5 to ground (provide the current value)
C1 5 2 <capacitance> ; Capacitor between nodes 5 and 2
R1 2 3 <resistance> ; Resistor between nodes 2 and 3 (node 3 is ground)
C2 2 4 <capacitance> ; Capacitor between nodes 2 and 4 (node 4 is ground)
Vout 2 6 ; Output node 6 connected to node 2
